            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The sprites rummage through the possessions of a single creature within their space, attempting a @Check[thievery|against:reflex] check against the creature's Reflex DC. On a success, the sprites take one item of negligible or light Bulk that the creature is carrying but not holding, nor can the item be readied. On a critical success, the item can be one that is held or readied, such as a weapon or potion.</p>"
                },
