            "privateNotes": "",
            "publicNotes": "<p>Individually and upon first impression, many sprites seem to be cute and harmless. However, should they get angry or feel the need to act en masse, they gather together into a dangerous swarm. Wielding needles or simply brandishing sharp teeth or claws, a swarm of sprites can catch the unwary by fatal surprise.</p><hr /><p>Elusive, flighty, and ebullient, sprites are what many villagers first imagine when they hear the terms \"fey\" or \"fairy.\"</p>",
